GsNebulaSpiralDirector.DisplayName: Bras spiraux de Nébula
GsNovaDetonationDirector.DisplayName: Détonation de nova
GsSpectreStaff.Desc: Reforged: every quarter of the gauge banked splits off an echo soul that hunts another nearby foe
